tle_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322216002:1":{"text":"とても焦っているようでしたので、何か良くないことが起きたのではないかと心配です。私の代わりに様子を見てきていただけますか？","source_cn":"瓦茨拉夫管家看起来好着急，我很担心是不是出了什么不好的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x260C5E1C13F087C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"カレリーナ","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222170.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1322217001:0":{"text":"あそこにキャンデラさんがいますよ！何に困っているのか聞いてみましょう。","source_cn":"管家先生在哪里！我们去看看他有什么需要帮助的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4E9C5F653F7B0E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222180.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322218001:1":{"text":"おお、カレリーナ様から話を聞いていらしたのですね？実は今、額縁のメンテナンスで困ったことが……","source_cn":"你们是卡列琳娜小姐邀请来帮忙的？太好了，我正为画框保养...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D41695326198BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322218002:1":{"text":"私は日頃からご主人様の作品の手入れをしているのですが、額縁が腐らないように保護する塗料がなくなってしまったのです……","source_cn":"我经常会为子爵先生做一些艺术品的日常保养，可是保养画框...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BE1BF361A7C605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322218003:1":{"text":"ですが私はここを離れるわけにはいかないので……なんとかお願いできないでしょうか？","source_cn":"而我不便离开这里，只好麻烦几位了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95C74292E10A69A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322218004:1":{"text":"塗料は植物のオイルから作られます。必ず天然の植物から抽出してくださいね。できれば、自然の香りも欲しいところです。ご主人様はその辺のこだわりが強いので……","source_cn":"保养需要一些植物油脂——记住，一定要从天然的植物中提取...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D09E82D283DDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"執事のキャンデラ","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222190.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322219001:1":{"text":"オイルも香り付けの材料も揃いましたね。これで額縁用の塗料が作れます。","source_cn":"这样油脂和香气就都有了，可以调配保养画框的涂料了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2358C16702C5A0A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:3:147:0":{"text":"木製品の手入れに使う塗料。密着性が高い上にべとつかない。塗った後は淡い果樹の香りが広がる。\n\n<style=\"highlight\">イエローリア</style>から抽出した油脂に、<style=\"highlight\">霜晶スグリ</style>の果汁を少量加える。割合は3：1が目安。","source_cn":"保养木制品的绝佳涂料，醇厚而不油腻，散发着果木的淡淡清香。\n\n提炼<style=\"highlight\">灵曼根</style>的油脂，再加入<style=\"highlight\">莹霜醋栗</style>的果汁，三比一的黄金比例。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71941052DB5C781","variant_status":"","male":"木製品の手入れに使う塗料。密着性が高い上にべとつかない。塗った後は淡い果樹の香りが広がる。\n\n<style=\"highlight\">イエローリア</style>から抽出した油脂に、<style=\"highlight\">霜晶スグリ</style>の果汁を少量加える。割合は3：1が目安。","female":"木製品の手入れに使う塗料。密着性が高い上にべとつかない。塗った後は淡い果樹の香りが広がる。\n\n<style=\"highlight\">イエローリア</style>から抽出した油脂に、<style=\"highlight\">霜晶スグリ</style>の果汁を少量加える。割合は3：1が目安。","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"塗料のレシピ","document_title_male":"塗料のレシピ","document_title_female":"塗料のレシピ","document_title_cn":"涂料的配方","document_title_status":"matched"},"narration:7:1320820006:0":{"text":"一通り調合が完了した……","source_cn":"经过一番调制……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040752681A084A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1320820006:0":{"text":"一通り調合が完了した……","source_cn":"经过一番调制……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040752681A084A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222200.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","text